<title>SWITZERLAND: SNB leaves Swiss discount unchanged at 1.00 pct.</title>
<headline>SNB leaves Swiss discount unchanged at 1.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss National Bank (SNB) left its discount rate unchanged at 1.00 percent after the regular meeting on Thursday of its three-man policy-setting board.</p>
<p>&quot;There were no changes,&quot; a SNB spokesman said in response to an enquiry.</p>
<p>The SNB last changed the rate on September 26, lowering it to 1.00 from 1.50 percent.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
